{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05080","headline":"天官崔侍郎夫人卢氏挽歌 · 沈佺期","name":"天官崔侍郎夫人卢氏挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偕老言何谬，香魂事永违。\n潘鱼从此隔，陈凤宛然飞。\n埋镜泉中暗，藏镫地下微。\n犹凭少君术，彷佛覩容辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}